<title>SOUTH KOREA: Chosun Brewery 1996 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Chosun Brewery 1996 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)		     980    vs	    960</p>
<p>    Net Profit		   8.12    vs	   7.26</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,994.37    vs     1,037.81</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	 11.41    vs	  11.60</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain	 0.12    vs	   1.82</p>
<p>Dividend (percent, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>	common shares  in cash 4.0     vs in stocks 4.0</p>
<p>	preferred shares  cash 5.0	     stocks 4.0</p>
<p>    Dividend Payment	    April 14-15</p>
<p>    Dividend Register	  December 31, 1996</p>
<p>NOTE : Chosun Brewery Co Ltd's share capital rose by 266,670 shares to 8,908,672 shares due to dividend payment and conversion of convertible bonds.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
</text>
